      "Moonveil Manifest": {
        "category": "ultimate",
        "description": {
          "raw": "Thador slams the ground with his shield, dealing 320% (ATK-based) + 30% (SP-based) damage to enemies within 2 tiles and conjuring a ritual zone for the Moonveil Rite. The ritual zone lasts for 12s and reduces the Crit DMG DEF of enemies within by 40. When enemies have accumulated damage totaling 1500% of Thador's initial ATK while inside the zone, he unleashes a shadow eruption dealing 160% of Team ATK damage to each enemy inside the zone. Each ally is then healed for 80% of the eruption's total damage dealt. The eruption can trigger once per Moonveil Rite.",
